  "goodToKnow": "Die Weltmeisterschaft (WM) is a world championship, especially the football World Cup. Germany hosted the 2006 WM, remembered as the Sommermärchen (summer fairy tale), when Germans waved flags with new, relaxed pride. Die WM schauen means watching the World Cup, often at Public Viewing events in squares and beer gardens."
